sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant PostResource
    participant PostService
    participant PostgreSQL

    Client->>PostResource: GET posts with X-tenant header
    Note right of Client: X-tenant: tenant identifier
    
    activate PostResource
    PostResource->>PostResource: findAll(tenant)
    Note right of PostResource: PostResource.findAll receives tenant from RequestHeader
    
    PostResource->>PostResource: System.out.println(tenant)
    Note right of PostResource: System.out.println logs tenant value
    
    PostResource->>PostService: findAll()
    Note right of PostResource: PostResource calls PostService.findAll
    
    activate PostService
    PostService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT * FROM post
    Note right of PostService: PostService retrieves all posts for tenant
    
    activate PostgreSQL
    PostgreSQL-->>PostService: return post rows
    Note right of PostgreSQL: Collection of Post objects
    deactivate PostgreSQL
    
    PostService-->>PostResource: return posts
    Note right of PostService: PostService returns List[Post]
    deactivate PostService
    
    PostResource->>PostResource: ResponseEntity.ok(posts)
    Note right of PostResource: PostResource wraps List in ResponseEntity
    
    PostResource-->>Client: HTTP 200 with Posts JSON array
    Note right of PostResource: ResponseEntity.ok().body(obj) returns HTTP 200 with Post list
    deactivate PostResource